						 <p>Author,</p> <p>As per the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-12255912/how-to-use-this-forum-drafts-critique">How to use this forum</a> thread at the top of this forum:</p> <blockquote> <p>If you're a first-time author, remember to provide a direct link to/information for your two <span style="color: green">greenlights</span>!</p> </blockquote> <p>If you have not yet received greenlights, please proceed to the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">ideas forum</a> and follow the guidelines set in the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-13095662/required-reading:how-to-use-this-forum-ideas">required reading</a>.</p> <p>Thank you.</p> 
